Hello, everyone and welcome to this lesson
on course updates and change logs for the
AWS Certified Solutions Architect Associate Certification.
My name is Chris Silva
and I'm a content maintenance architect.
As part of our ongoing efforts to provide you
with the most up-to-date content,
our team is regularly updating lessons, labs,
and quizzes and exams, along with updating the content.
As time goes on, some lessons,
labs, or entire sections may be replaced, removed,
or shifted around to line up
with the latest version of the exam.
But rest assured,
that this course will cover everything you need
to be successful in your exam.
To help you identify what has changed in this course,
we provided a change log that can be found
in the resources section of this lesson that looks similar
to the change log you see here.
Any changes made to this course
will be included in the change log,
so you're always up to date
on the latest happenings with this course.
If you have any questions, please feel free to reach out
as we're always willing to help.
Best of luck on your exam and keep being awesome.